cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this model, please cite the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation below).
title: CybersecurityRiskAnalyst
abstract: >-
  A custom fine-tuned Large Language Model designed to act as a senior
  cybersecurity risk assessor and strategist. Fine-tuned from Llama 3.1 8B;
  supports NIST CSF, CIS Controls, MITRE ATT&CK, and ISO/IEC 27001 framework
  mapping, gap analysis, and prioritized remediation recommendations.
type: software
